\DOC ASM_SIMPS_TAC

\TYPE {ASM_SIMPS_TAC : thm list -> tactic}

\SYNOPSIS
Simplify the goal with the simp set, the assumptions and some more
theorems.

\DESCRIBE
{ASM_SIMPS_TAC thl} is {SIMPS_TAC} with the assumptions of the goal added
to the rewrites; it is {ASM SIMPS_TAC}.

\FAILURE
Fails if the goal cannot be simplified.

\EXAMPLE
{
  # g `forall x. x = Num 3 ==> count x = 1`;;
  # e (REPEAT STRIP_TAC THEN ASM_SIMPS_TAC[]);;
  val it : goalstack = No subgoals
}

\SEEALSO
add_simp, ASM, ASM_SIMP_TAC, SIMPS_TAC.

\ENDDOC
